  "adaptation": "Preserve Core graph camera, pointer, measured cards, typed ports and explanation machinery. Inject application semantics/settings, generalize layout from mocap IDs to ordered workflow. Reuse actual MocapSetupModal header/body, ProcessingOutline and StageSection composition plus SettingRow/Select/Toggle/ValueSelector/AnchoredInfo and complete CSS. Core unchanged. Current layout: two rows of 360px measured cards at100percent default, all settings independently expanded; explicit FitAll overview only. SidebarProcessingAction retains actual ProcessMocapPanel button/icon/accent/fullwidth structure with44px target. Native dialog adds focus containment/return; floating info portal follows owning dialog; ValueSelector adds optional accessible label.",
  "disclosure_revision": "Shared expansion state across views, all expanded initially, camera-independent disclosure, wrapped measured headers/ports, rounded gutter routes, host-injected file picker with full path; native select wrapped closed value."
